## WORKSPACE

```python
load("@bazel_tools//tools/build_defs/repo:http.bzl", "http_archive")
http_archive(
    name = "rules_doxygen",
    integrity = "sha256-{sha256_base64}",
    urls = ["https://github.com/abrisco/rules_doxygen/releases/download/{version}/rules_doxygen-{version}.tar.gz"],
)
```
